- **Conclusion.** This has two shapes: an invariant/obligation and a lower bound.
  - **(a) Obligation.** $\mathbb{E}_{\pi_z}[\sum_t\gamma^tr_M(s_{t+1})] = F(s,a,z)^\top z$ for all $(s,a)$ and all $z$ $\iff$ $M = \Sigma_B^{-1}$.
